<!--
    Themed-icon layer (Android 13+ tints it with the wallpaper colours): the emblem reduced to one
    flat shape — a round cut gem set in the eight-pointed khatam star. Hand-written; only the alpha
    matters. 108dp canvas, everything inside the 66dp safe zone (the star spans 56dp).
-->
